@ref{Exercise 2.46} to define a representation for segments with a constructor
@code{makeSegment} and selectors @code{startSegment} and @code{endSegment}.
@end quotation

@quotation
@strong{@anchor{Exercise 2.49}Exercise 2.49:} Use @code{segmentsToPainter}
to define the following primitive painters:

